form: nil. Accessor: disposed-p.") (:p ":state-style — State overrides: plist mapping :HOVER/:PRESSED/:DISABLED/:FOCUS to token plists. Valid values: list. Default form: nil. Accessor: state-style.") (:p ":tooltip-text — Optional help shown while the pointer hovers over this widget. Valid values: (or null string). Default form: nil. Accessor: tooltip-text.") (:p ":hovered-p — Pointer is over this widget. Valid values: boolean. Default form: nil. Accessor: hovered-p.") (:p ":pressed-p — Pointer is captured by this widget. Valid values: boolean. Default form: nil. Accessor: pressed-p.")) ("Example" (:code-block "lisp" "(lut:make-widget 'lut:button)"))))
